  PassiveManager: {fileID: 703755477591488484, guid: 67c0452ffa8730e4cb41b5b5ceac85e8, type: 3}
  PassiveName: Heating up!
  ShortDescription: When Bastian uses he's normal attacks or some abilities, he will
    gain heat. When he's heat goes up he will gain certain buffs.
  LongDescription: 'When Bastian uses he''s normal attacks or some abilities, he
    will gain heat. Bastian has 4 heat zones:

    Neutral zone: Nothing happens

    Heat
    zone: Bastian gains attack speed

    SuperHeat zone: Bastian gains penetration
    in his normal attacks and more attack speed. Bastian looses health while he is
    in this zone

    OverHeat zonee: Bastian gain garanteed crit in his next tree
    normal attacks, the last one deals increased crit damage.'
